---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy, Dr. Itzia Morales">
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20" style="background: #FAF8F4;">
    <div class="section-container">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="mb-14">
          <div
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest mb-6"
            style="background: rgba(29,78,95,0.08); color: #1D4E5F; border: 1px solid rgba(29,78,95,0.12);"
          >
            Legal
          </div>
          <h1 class="font-display text-display-lg leading-tight mb-4" style="color: #1C1917;">
            Cookie Policy
          </h1>
          <p class="text-sm" style="color: #78716C;">
            Last updated: June 2026
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Content -->
        <div class="prose-legal space-y-10 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: #44403C;">

          <div>
            <p class="mb-3">
              This Cookie Policy explains how <strong>MY CLINICAL PSYCHOLOGIST LTD</strong> ("we", "us")
              uses cookies and similar technologies on our website. It should be read alongside our
              <a href="/privacy" class="underline underline-offset-2" style="color: #1D4E5F;">Privacy Policy</a>.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-xl mb-3" style="color: #1C1917;">What are cookies?</h2>
            <p>
              Cookies are small text files that are placed on your device when you visit a website.
              They are widely used to make websites work, or work more efficiently, as well as to
              provide information to the site owners. Similar technologies, such as local storage, may
              be used for the same purposes.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-xl mb-3" style="color: #1C1917;">How we use cookies</h2>
            <p class="mb-3">Our website uses cookies to:</p>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #1D4E5F;"></span><span>Make the website function correctly and securely;</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #1D4E5F;"></span><span>Remember your preferences (such as your cookie choices);</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #1D4E5F;"></span><span>Enable the booking and payment features provided by our trusted third-party partners.</span></li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-3">
              We do not use advertising cookies, and we do not sell your data.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-xl mb-3" style="color: #1C1917;">Types of cookies we use</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #7A9E7E;"></span><span><strong>Strictly necessary cookies:</strong> Required for the website to function and for you to move around it and use its features. These cannot be switched off in our systems.</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #7A9E7E;"></span><span><strong>Preference cookies:</strong> Remember choices you make (such as whether you have accepted this cookie notice) so we don't ask you again.</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #7A9E7E;"></span><span><strong>Third-party cookies:</strong> Set by the trusted services we use to run bookings and payments (see below). These are governed by each provider's own privacy and cookie policies.</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-xl mb-3" style="color: #1C1917;">Third-party services</h2>
            <p class="mb-3">
              When you use certain features of our website, cookies may be set by the following
              third-party providers:
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #C17D5C;"></span><span><strong>Zanda</strong> - appointment scheduling and client portal.</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #C17D5C;"></span><span><strong>Calendly</strong> - free consultation scheduling.</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #C17D5C;"></span><span><strong>Stripe</strong> - secure payment processing.</span></li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-3">
              Each of these providers has its own privacy and cookie policy governing how they use
              cookies and process data.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-xl mb-3" style="color: #1C1917;">Managing your cookies</h2>
            <p>
              Most web browsers allow you to control cookies through their settings. You can set your
              browser to refuse cookies, or to alert you when cookies are being sent. Please note that
              if you disable or refuse cookies, some parts of this website may become inaccessible or
              not function properly. For more information about how to manage cookies, visit your
              browser's help pages.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-xl mb-3" style="color: #1C1917;">Changes to this policy</h2>
            <p>
              We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time to reflect changes in the cookies we
              use or for other operational, legal or regulatory reasons. Please revisit this page
              periodically to stay informed.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-xl mb-3" style="color: #1C1917;">Contact</h2>
            <p>
              If you have any questions about our use of cookies, please contact us at
              <a href="mailto:info@myclinicalpsychologist.co.uk" class="underline underline-offset-2" style="color: #1D4E5F;">info@myclinicalpsychologist.co.uk</a>
              or <a href="tel:+442030511593" class="underline underline-offset-2" style="color: #1D4E5F;">020 3051 1593</a>.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Back link -->
        <div class="mt-14 pt-8" style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(29,78,95,0.08);">
          <a href="/"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-200"
            style="color: #1D4E5F;"
          >
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
              <path d="M13 8H3M7 4L3 8l4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
            Back to Home
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
